---
layout: layouts/base.njk
title: Blog
permalink: /blog/
description: Beiträge zu regenerativem Wirtschaften – Purpose, Strategie, Organisationsdesign und Fallbeispiele.
---
<header class="page-head wrap">
  <span class="label">Journal · {{ collections.posts.length }} Beiträge</span>
  <h1 class="display">Gedanken zu einer regenerativen Wirtschaft.</h1>
</header>
<section class="wrap blog-list" style="padding-bottom:clamp(4rem,8vw,7rem)">
  {% include "partials/topic-filter.njk" %}
  <p class="filter-empty" hidden>Zu diesem Thema gibt es noch keine Beiträge.</p>
  <div class="cards" data-filter-target>
    {%- for post in collections.posts %}
    {%- set feature = loop.first %}
    {% include "partials/post-card.njk" %}
    {%- endfor %}
  </div>
</section>
{% include "partials/newsletter.njk" %}
